{"id":"8105afc544202519","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-recursive-function.md","title":"Recursive Function","display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-recursive-function","aliases":["90-df-recursive-function"],"display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-recursive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-recursive-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(f\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Partial}\">\\(\\operatorname{Partial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)\\)</span> 表示 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a> 中以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span> 输入输出的机器可计算部分函数谓词，不是本书复合算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartRec}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rec}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\\land\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartRec}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rec}(f)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\\land\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartRec},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{TMComp}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartRec},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{TMComp}\\)</span> 的一元谓词接口，显式给出原先只有说明文字的计算性来源。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rec}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rec}\\)</span> 在这里是谓词；按元数的函数类取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>，不得把谓词无声明地当作类。全性与部分可计算性是不同条件。</p>\n<p>零元情形沿用原接口：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\)</span>，用空元组的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span> 作为输入；不删去零元递归函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$f\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{Partial}$ 见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)$ 表示 [[88-df-computable-function]] 中以 $\\operatorname{wordenc}$ 输入输出的机器可计算部分函数谓词，不是本书复合算子 $\\operatorname{Comp}$。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"保留 $\\operatorname{PartRec},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{TMComp}$ 的一元谓词接口，显式给出原先只有说明文字的计算性来源。$\\operatorname{Rec}$ 在这里是谓词；按元数的函数类取 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]，不得把谓词无声明地当作类。全性与部分可计算性是不同条件。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Partial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\operatorname{Comp}^{88}_k(f),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PartRec}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Rec}(f)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ [\n\\operatorname{Partial}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\mathbb N^k\\land\\operatorname{TMComp}(f)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartRec},\\operatorname{Rec},\\operatorname{TMComp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}","display":false}],"bytes":1674,"backlinks":[{"id":"150af883bccb8887","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为函数图；$\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 分别指 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{Partial}$ 和 [[90-df-recursive-function]] 的 $\\mathrm{PartRec}$。上标仅消除跨册同名混淆，不是新谓词。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 保持本册原本的**部分递归**含义，不改成 90 的总递归谓词。原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartRec}(f),\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ (partial/total recursive predicates, see [[90-df-recursive-function]])"},{"id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"可接受编号谓词 $\\operatorname{AcceptNum}$ 取 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]，以本书 $\\Phi$ 及 [[90-df-recursive-function]] 的计算函数类实例化；序列计算性质见 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function]]、[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\n[[90-df-haltseq.md]]\n[[90-df-hbl-conditions.md]]\n[[90-df-henkin-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-hypersimple-set.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-extension.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-